        "created_at": "2021-06-05T16:21:56.320Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That’s correct. Once the board is set up, each player selects a different board to be their starting board and then follows the set up instructions on the back of their spirit panel. If you’re playing Sharp Fangs you can place a oresence on a different board, but this is explicitly called out.</p>",
